    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I was thinking about the CNS side of things. Sometimes it feels like even when the programming looks perfect on paper, there's just this inexplicable resistance or something holding the progress back. Is there any way to tell if the plateau is just pure fatigue versus some other kind of metabolic or neurological hurdle?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
