      "content": "Gotcha, so it's mostly about checking the biomarkers and performance data. I'm just worried because even when we handle the recovery and the nutrition, it's like there's this invisible wall they keep hitting. It feels almost... unnatural, like some hidden factor is just sabotaging the gains right when they should be happening. Do you think there are any psychological or environmental \"hidden\" factors that can act like a brake on progress?",
